# Performance

This library must be fast as well as correct. Follow [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Do

- Reuse the time index when an op only changes values (`withValues`)
- Pre-size slices to the output length
- Use two-pointer merges and binary search on the sorted index
- Special-case same-index float64 ops (lag, diff, arithmetic) instead of generic align
- Add/update `bench_test.go` when changing fill, rolling, resample, interpolate, or math

## Do not

- Copy `times` just because `values` changed
- Call `New` again after you already built a valid index
- Mutate a series’ backing slices in place
- Introduce O(n²) nested scans over the series
- Add SIMD, GPU, or a parallel API without updating INTENTIONS
